``task_patterns`` (not AND). Hard isolation is ``target_base`` +
``knowledge_types`` + ``access_scope``. For ``orchestrator_routing``,
``keyword_families`` are routing tags (``XLSX``, ``INC``, ``COMMISSIONING``),
